msgid "%d agent session(s) are running and will be left as they are."
msgstr "%d 个智能体会话正在运行，将保持原状。"

msgid ""
"Address the FCC server listens on. The FCC Admin page is served through "
"LuCI, which reaches the server on 127.0.0.1, so keep that unless another "
"device must reach the FCC API directly. Only 0.0.0.0 exposes the server to "
"the LAN, and it adds a LAN-only firewall rule; the port is never opened to "
"the WAN. Any other address is narrowed to 127.0.0.1, because the Admin page "
"cannot be reached through one."
msgstr ""
"FCC 服务器监听的地址。FCC Admin 页面通过 LuCI 提供，LuCI 会以 127.0.0.1 访问"
"服务器，因此除非有其他设备需要直接访问 FCC API，否则请保持该值。只有 0.0.0.0 "
"会把服务器暴露到局域网，并会添加一条仅限局域网的防火墙规则；该端口绝不会对 "
"WAN 开放。其他任何地址都会被收窄为 127.0.0.1，因为无法通过这类地址打开 Admin "
"页面。"

