msgstr "所有未保存的终端状态都将丢失。"

msgid ""
"An interactive terminal running a coding agent on this router. Sessions keep "
"running after you close this page, and reattaching to one restores its "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"在此路由器上直接运行智能体的交互式终端。关闭本页面后会话仍会继续运行，重新连"
"接即可恢复会话记录。"

