msgid ""
"Directory where an install sets its rollback copy aside — the previous "
"runtime, and your data as it was before the install. It needs room for a "
"full copy of the FCC data directory, so it is /tmp/fcc by default: /tmp is "
"memory on OpenWrt, which keeps the copy off the flash the runtime lives on. "
"The copy is removed as soon as the install ends either way. Set this to the "
"install path if you would rather keep it beside the runtime."
msgstr ""
"安装时保存回滚副本的目录——上一版运行时，以及安装前的数据。它需要能容纳一份完"
"整的 FCC 数据目录副本，因此默认是 /tmp/fcc：在 OpenWrt 上 /tmp 位于内存，可让"
"副本不占用运行时所在的闪存。无论安装成功还是失败，副本都会在安装结束后删除。"
"若希望把副本与运行时放在一起，可将此项设为安装路径。"

msgid ""
"Do not choose every agent in the registry when installing: the download is "
"extremely slow and takes about 8 GB of storage. Choose only the agents you "
"need."
msgstr ""
"安装时请勿选注册表中的全部智能体，否则会导致下载极其缓慢并占用约 8GB 存储空"
"间。建议仅选需要的智能体进行安装。"

